Z||000000||Ronnie||01-16-2001||08:53 PM||||Would someone please tell me how to get the door glass out of the door.Do you remove the runner from the glass? If so , how?<P>------------------<BR>Black '86GT 4spd / Silver '87GT 5spd<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/BOTHGTS_1.jpg"> ||||reg||6
Z||000001||Phil||01-16-2001||10:33 PM||||Take off the inner door panel then carefully punch out the steel inserts in the aluminium rivets. Drill out the AL rivets and remove the glass. ||||reg||1
